==English==

===Noun===
{{infl|en|noun|head=[[petrol]] [[blue]]}}

# {{UK}} a [[grey]]ish [[blue]] colour, tinted with [[green]].

====Usage notes====
Many people erroneously believe that this is a misspelling of [[petrel]] blue, and that the term refers to the sea bird.  However, the [[OED]] gives only this spelling and ties the term to petrol-derived compounds such as [[paraffin]].

===Adjective===
{{infl|en|adjective|head=[[petrol]] [[blue]]}}

